<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>31 SKU 选品决策卡</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#13233f">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="SKU决策">
<link rel="manifest" href="./manifest.webmanifest">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="./icons/icon-180.png">

<style>
:root{--bg:#f5f7fb;--card:#fff;--text:#172033;--muted:#6b7280;--line:#e5e7eb;--good:#0f9f6e;--warn:#d97706;--bad:#dc2626;--blue:#2563eb;--soft:#eef4ff;}
*{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:var(--text)}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px} .hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#13233f,#203c67);color:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:22px}
.hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:24px} .hero p{margin:0;color:#dbeafe;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:16px} .kpi{background:rgba(255,255,255,.11);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:14px;padding:12px}
.kpi b{font-size:23px;display:block} .kpi span{font-size:12px;color:#dbeafe}
.toolbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:10px;margin:14px 0} select{width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:#fff;font-size:15px}
.toggle{display:flex;gap:6px} .toggle button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:9px 12px;cursor:pointer}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(15,23,42,.06)} 
.titleline{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px} h2{margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.35} .family{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
.badge{padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap} .good{background:#dcfce7;color:#067647} .warn{background:#fff7ed;color:#b45309} .bad{background:#fee2e2;color:#b91c1c}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:14px} .metric{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:11px;background:#fafafa}
.metric small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:5px} .metric strong{font-size:18px} .metric .sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.spec{margin-top:14px;padding:12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65}
.links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:14px} .links a{text-decoration:none;text-align:center;padding:11px 8px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;background:#fff;color:#1e3a5f}
.links a:hover{background:var(--soft);border-color:#93c5fd} .links a:nth-child(4),.links a:nth-child(5){background:#eff6ff}
.note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
.ranking{margin-top:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:16px;overflow:auto} table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:850px} th,td{padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2f7;text-align:left;font-size:12px} th{color:#64748b;background:#f8fafc;position:sticky;top:0} tr{cursor:pointer} tr:hover{background:#f8fbff}
.pos{color:#067647;font-weight:700} .neg{color:#b91c1c;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:760px){.kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.toolbar{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.links{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.links a:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}}

/* PWA/mobile stability additions: preserve original UI, improve touch only */
button,select,a{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent} button,select{min-height:44px}
.install-tip{display:none;position:fixed;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));z-index:50;background:#172033;color:white;border-radius:14px;padding:11px 38px 11px 13px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.25)}
.install-tip button{position:absolute;right:8px;top:7px;border:0;background:transparent;color:#fff;font-size:18px;min-height:28px;padding:0 7px}
@media(max-width:760px){.wrap{padding:10px}.hero{padding:16px;border-radius:18px}.hero h1{font-size:20px}.toggle{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.toggle button{padding:8px 6px;font-size:12px}.card{padding:14px}.metric strong{font-size:16px}.ranking{padding:10px;border-radius:16px}.links a{min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}}
</style>
</head>
<body><div class="wrap">
<div class="hero"><h1>31 SKU 选品决策驾驶舱</h1><p>总览 → 排名 → SKU选择 → 单项完整决策卡。每个SKU均固定提供：1688、淘宝、拼多多、WB竞品、Ozon竞品 5个可点击入口。</p>
<div class="kpis"><div class="kpi"><b>31</b><span>可计算SKU</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>16</b><span>净利率≥15%</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>1</b><span>正利润但＜15%</span></div><div class="kpi"><b>14</b><span>负利润SKU</span></div></div></div>
<div class="toolbar"><select id="skuSelect"></select><div class="toggle"><button onclick="sortBy('margin')">按净利率</button><button onclick="sortBy('profit')">按单件利润</button><button onclick="sortBy('month')">按月利润</button></div></div>
<div id="detail"></div>
<div class="ranking"><table><thead><tr><th>排名</th><th>SKU</th><th>售价</th><th>实际/情景成本</th><th>目标成本</th><th>单件利润</th><th>净利率</th><th>预计月单量</th><th>月利润代理值</th></tr></thead><tbody id="tbody"></tbody></table></div>
</div>
<div id="installTip" class="install-tip">在 Safari 点“分享” → “添加到主屏幕”，以后可像 App 一样打开。<button aria-label="关闭" onclick="this.parentElement.style.display='none';localStorage.setItem('pwaTipHidden','1')">×</button></div>
